      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Roll five dice and try to score the best combinations. You can roll up
    to three times each turn, choosing which dice to keep and which to reroll. After
    your final roll, select a scoring category to lock in your points  but each category
    can only be used once. Complete all categories and aim for the highest total
    score!\n\n          - Count & Add only Ones                - 3 of a Kind,Add
    all same Dice\n\n          - Count & Add only Twos                - 4 of a Kind,
    Add all same Dice           \n\n          - Count & Add only Threes            
    - Sequence of 4 , 30 points\n\n          - Count & Add only  Fours             
    - Sequence of 5 , 40 points\n\n          - Count & Add only  Fives              
    - Full house, 25 points \n\n          - Count & Add only  Sixs                
    - 5 of a Kind, 50 points\n\n                - Score Total of 5 Dice\n\n\n\n\n"
